description=v3.6.5 the frame-rate cap armed properly: the module's own system.prop turns the phone's frame-rate override on at boot - before the compositor starts - so the owner-verified 30 fps command (SurfaceFlinger 1035) can never crash it, and the option refuses honestly until that first reboot. The Recents button stays the phone's own. RMX3430.
